WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Sit tall with legs extended. Bend the right knee and step the right foot outside the left thigh.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Bend the left knee and tuck the left heel beside the right hip, or keep the left leg straight.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Inhale and lift the left arm; exhale and hook the left elbow outside the right knee.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Place the right hand behind you, lengthen the crown up, and twist from the belly on each exhale.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Gaze gently over the right shoulder. Unwind and switch sides.
